WEBVTT

00:00:18.614 --> 00:00:27.144
Kanashimi ikuta noseshi fune

00:00:29.124 --> 00:00:39.334
Horobi no uta no koe takaku

00:00:44.144 --> 00:00:48.664
Kuraki soko yori

00:00:50.114 --> 00:00:55.214
Ukabi koshi

00:00:59.184 --> 00:01:10.324
Aa kimi to ima shirogane o nuke

00:01:11.134 --> 00:01:22.074
Ozora e futari tobu hi no

00:01:22.074 --> 00:01:36.254
Kuru o yume min, kuru o yume min

00:01:41.964 --> 00:01:47.194
And the prince and princess
lived happily ever after,

00:01:47.734 --> 00:01:50.204
for ever and ever!

00:01:50.544 --> 00:01:52.974
Miss Kozuki! Miss Kozuki!

00:01:54.014 --> 00:01:59.644
About the script I asked you to write...
we'll need to start preparing, soon...

00:02:00.814 --> 00:02:03.984
I was wondering how it's coming.

00:02:04.824 --> 00:02:09.194
I need a bit more time...

00:02:14.694 --> 00:02:18.294
Crushing emotions.

00:02:32.714 --> 00:02:35.584
You seem kind of blue. You okay?

00:02:36.854 --> 00:02:41.084
I'm just fine! I was just thinking...

00:02:42.424 --> 00:02:44.914
About what Teacher Yuko said, right?

00:02:45.824 --> 00:02:47.424
Are you having trouble with the play?

00:02:48.494 --> 00:02:53.024
Oh, I'm almost done.
It should be finished next week...

00:02:53.704 --> 00:02:56.294
Really? I knew you could do it!

00:03:03.844 --> 00:03:07.184
Sign
For the time being
access to the library
is prohibited
(Until Michiko Kozuki's script is done.)
- Dorm Chief Hiroko Funatsumaru

00:03:15.554 --> 00:03:17.714
Let's do this. Here goes!

00:03:36.884 --> 00:03:38.434
Pathetic!

00:03:40.044 --> 00:03:41.314
Huh?

00:03:43.724 --> 00:03:45.184
How come you're here?

00:03:45.884 --> 00:03:47.424
Where's Hagino?

00:03:47.424 --> 00:03:52.364
The Commander got up and left some time ago,
unlike some people!

00:03:53.394 --> 00:03:56.524
She said she had to see her teacher...

00:03:57.734 --> 00:03:59.754
Oh, too bad.

00:03:59.964 --> 00:04:02.634
On the weekend and everything...

00:04:06.004 --> 00:04:08.734
I have to turn in my report today!

00:04:14.884 --> 00:04:17.014
Honestly, these Forime!

00:04:17.684 --> 00:04:19.824
Slovenly, unstable, indecisive...

00:04:19.824 --> 00:04:20.084
Easy as Pie Weight Loss!
Burn fat just reading!
The ultimate formula!
3-5 minutes per day
Slovenly, unstable, indecisive...

00:04:20.084 --> 00:04:20.354
Easy as Pie Weight Loss!
Burn fat just reading!
The ultimate formula!
3-5 minutes per day

00:04:20.354 --> 00:04:21.354
Easy as Pie Weight Loss!
Burn fat just reading!
The ultimate formula!
3-5 minutes per day
Such a vulnerable species!

00:04:21.354 --> 00:04:23.054
Such a vulnerable species!

00:04:30.204 --> 00:04:32.324
Ooh, Lady Hagino!

00:04:32.404 --> 00:04:33.864
She's so gorgeous!

00:04:34.604 --> 00:04:36.434
I want copies of this!

00:04:37.274 --> 00:04:39.674
For Pete's sake! Ridiculous!

00:04:41.214 --> 00:04:42.764
Are you serious, Commander?

00:04:43.044 --> 00:04:47.104
You want to release the prisoner?
But it's too dangerous!

00:04:48.654 --> 00:04:51.014
I have no cause to imprison her.

00:04:51.254 --> 00:04:52.584
Yes, but...

00:04:52.584 --> 00:04:53.924
How is she?

00:04:55.224 --> 00:04:58.664
For now, there's nothing really to report.

00:05:01.964 --> 00:05:05.924
But there's no question she's up to no good!

00:05:06.304 --> 00:05:08.564
I'll continue to monitor her closely!

00:05:09.774 --> 00:05:10.904
I'm not worried.

00:05:10.904 --> 00:05:12.464
But...

00:05:13.204 --> 00:05:15.644
It's all right. Blue's watching her.

00:05:15.774 --> 00:05:20.474
Besides, it was Onomil's ship.

00:05:25.824 --> 00:05:26.624
For the time being
access to the library
is prohibited
(Until Michiko Kozuki's script is done.)
- Dorm Chief Hiroko Funatsumaru

00:05:26.624 --> 00:05:29.924
For the time being
access to the library
is prohibited
(Until Michiko Kozuki's script is done.)
- Dorm Chief Hiroko Funatsumaru
For the time being... access is prohibited?

00:05:30.594 --> 00:05:31.954
What's this?

00:05:41.004 --> 00:05:43.234
An unusually hardworking Forime!

00:05:46.544 --> 00:05:47.834
Finished!

00:05:57.454 --> 00:06:00.144
I really shouldn't be messing around!

00:06:00.294 --> 00:06:01.814
Stupid, stupid, stupid!

00:06:01.954 --> 00:06:05.254
Such a self-sabotaging species!

00:06:10.304 --> 00:06:12.864
Really, the commander these days

00:06:12.864 --> 00:06:15.534
seems overly influenced by these Forime!

00:06:24.284 --> 00:06:24.784
Chemistry Lab

00:06:24.784 --> 00:06:28.254
Chemistry Lab
North, Central, West, and South...

00:06:28.254 --> 00:06:28.454
Chemistry Lab

00:06:28.454 --> 00:06:29.314
Southwest Air Defense Command
Investigative Report

00:06:29.314 --> 00:06:33.054
Southwest Air Defense Command
Investigative Report
None of the Defense Commands
has any corresponding records.

00:06:33.054 --> 00:06:33.284
Southwest Air Defense Command
Investigative Report

00:06:33.824 --> 00:06:38.194
There's obviously a powerful entity involved.

00:06:43.394 --> 00:06:47.594
Someone with aircraft undetectable by radar!

00:06:48.134 --> 00:06:49.104
Aliens

00:06:49.674 --> 00:06:51.934
Impossible... right?

00:06:53.174 --> 00:06:54.574
It's Senkoji.

00:06:54.574 --> 00:06:55.634
Come in.

00:06:56.414 --> 00:06:57.644
Excuse me.

00:06:58.314 --> 00:07:00.444
Sorry to call you in on the weekend.

00:07:00.784 --> 00:07:01.854
Oh, no.

00:07:01.854 --> 00:07:04.584
Not at all. What did you want to discuss?

00:07:04.584 --> 00:07:09.754
Well, we need to start preparing
for the school festival soon...

00:07:09.924 --> 00:07:12.414
Is this about Miss Kozuki's play?

00:07:13.064 --> 00:07:19.434
You're dorm mates and all.
Would you mind checking in on her?

00:07:20.234 --> 00:07:21.634
I understand.

00:07:22.434 --> 00:07:27.744
Teacher! My report!
I brought in the one from last week!

00:07:28.044 --> 00:07:28.714
Huh?

00:07:28.714 --> 00:07:31.444
Let's see. Is it really finished?

00:07:43.724 --> 00:07:45.854
Come out. Commander's orders.

00:07:46.564 --> 00:07:49.394
You're being granted basic
freedom to move about.

00:07:50.664 --> 00:07:52.154
Thank you.

00:07:54.704 --> 00:08:00.604
Attended by local V.I.P. S, this play will be
recorded in the annals of Kaio history!

00:08:10.884 --> 00:08:12.584
I need to get a grip!

00:08:14.154 --> 00:08:15.814
Entry granted.

00:08:26.104 --> 00:08:31.404
Hey. Remember, this doesn't
mean you're forgiven.

00:08:31.874 --> 00:08:36.244
I know. Where's my vessel?

00:08:37.014 --> 00:08:38.344
Don't worry.

00:08:38.714 --> 00:08:41.304
It's safe in the hangar, repaired and serviced.

00:08:42.014 --> 00:08:44.314
Of course, you're not allowed access.

00:08:45.424 --> 00:08:47.284
We can't have you running off!

00:08:47.894 --> 00:08:49.584
I don't intend to.

00:08:51.024 --> 00:08:53.124
Not now, at least.

00:09:03.074 --> 00:09:05.094
Teacher Yuko sure was pleased!

00:09:06.074 --> 00:09:08.304
She must have been very concerned.

00:09:08.974 --> 00:09:14.144
Michi's really been working hard.
I wonder what the story's about.

00:09:14.454 --> 00:09:15.554
Yes, that's something to look forward to.

00:09:15.554 --> 00:09:19.044
A school festival... I wonder what it'll be like.

00:09:19.654 --> 00:09:22.214
Last year there were TV reporters.

00:09:22.454 --> 00:09:24.184
TV reporters?!

00:09:24.524 --> 00:09:26.324
That's incredible!

00:09:26.424 --> 00:09:28.654
Kaio's school festival's very well known.

00:09:36.174 --> 00:09:38.164
Miss Kozuki!

00:09:42.614 --> 00:09:45.804
Perfect timing! I was just coming to see you!

00:09:46.014 --> 00:09:49.574
I heard the news! The script will
be ready next week, right?

00:09:50.014 --> 00:09:52.954
What a relief! I was really worried!

00:09:53.284 --> 00:09:56.124
Oh! Well I...

00:09:56.124 --> 00:09:57.284
Here, take this!

00:09:57.394 --> 00:10:00.724
To keep you going!
Hang in there... you're almost done!

00:10:02.334 --> 00:10:05.094
Okay! I look forward to next week!

00:10:19.814 --> 00:10:22.014
Hey, Michi! Taking a break?

00:10:22.954 --> 00:10:26.314
Oh, wow! Where'd you get that!

00:10:26.384 --> 00:10:28.414
Teacher Yuko brought it...

00:10:31.094 --> 00:10:34.224
You sure? Goodie!

00:10:35.034 --> 00:10:40.664
When I told Teacher Yuko you were almost
done, she seemed really relieved!

00:10:40.834 --> 00:10:42.274
Wow!

00:10:42.274 --> 00:10:45.004
She must have been really thrilled!

00:10:46.874 --> 00:10:52.404
Sound's like Miss Maiyama's
really been hassling her...

00:10:53.084 --> 00:10:55.014
This looks great!

00:10:58.084 --> 00:11:03.584
By the way, what's the story about?
Could you just tell me a bit?

00:11:06.724 --> 00:11:08.164
Michi?

00:11:25.644 --> 00:11:31.784
Captured Novaal pilot has selected
residential chamber B-5037.

00:11:32.524 --> 00:11:37.354
She requests permission to
stay there while aboard.

00:11:38.564 --> 00:11:40.254
B-5037...

00:11:41.764 --> 00:11:44.424
Onomil's room.

00:11:46.304 --> 00:11:47.424
Granted.

00:11:48.174 --> 00:11:49.634
Roger.

00:11:50.074 --> 00:11:51.634
Okay, I'm recording!

00:11:54.874 --> 00:11:56.344
Like this?

00:11:56.344 --> 00:11:57.834
Yes, that's right!

00:11:59.344 --> 00:12:00.674
Miss Kozuki?

00:12:00.954 --> 00:12:03.514
Yes, she was acting funny.

00:12:04.924 --> 00:12:06.544
Michi, are you there?

00:12:07.154 --> 00:12:08.684
Miss Kozuki? We're coming in!

00:12:10.824 --> 00:12:12.124
Michi?

00:12:12.494 --> 00:12:14.124
She's not here.

00:12:15.464 --> 00:12:17.394
Wonder where she went.

00:12:18.904 --> 00:12:20.664
Does this mean...

00:12:21.704 --> 00:12:24.444
She hasn't even started?

00:12:24.444 --> 00:12:25.774
It looks that way.

00:12:29.444 --> 00:12:32.344
Dear classmates and Teacher Yuko,

00:12:32.714 --> 00:12:33.844
I'm so sorry.

00:12:35.314 --> 00:12:37.144
Don't look for me.

00:12:37.484 --> 00:12:38.854
Kozuki.

00:12:47.734 --> 00:12:51.464
Welcome! What can I do for you?

00:12:51.664 --> 00:12:51.734
Kozuki Produce

00:12:51.734 --> 00:12:54.574
Kozuki Produce
That's 350 yen back. Thank you!

00:12:54.574 --> 00:12:54.864
That's 350 yen back. Thank you!

00:13:03.474 --> 00:13:06.074
What am I doing?

00:13:08.854 --> 00:13:11.784
Michiko! You have a visitor!

00:13:13.284 --> 00:13:15.354
Thank you for coming. That child!

00:13:15.354 --> 00:13:21.664
Pops up suddenly with no warning, and runs
straight up to her room without a word!

00:13:22.394 --> 00:13:24.424
Michiko! Your friend is...

00:13:25.334 --> 00:13:26.464
Oh dear!

00:13:28.334 --> 00:13:30.934
She was hear a moment ago!

00:14:01.004 --> 00:14:03.064
The engine room.

00:14:07.374 --> 00:14:09.404
Emergency controls?

00:14:10.574 --> 00:14:14.344
Don't tell me... this is where...

00:14:16.084 --> 00:14:21.524
Sorry she up and skedaddled after
you came all this way!

00:14:21.724 --> 00:14:23.744
It's all right!

00:14:24.264 --> 00:14:29.124
She was always such a quiet, easy child!

00:14:29.634 --> 00:14:36.634
We were busy with the shop,
but she always entertained herself,

00:14:36.634 --> 00:14:39.434
making things and such.

00:15:02.534 --> 00:15:03.824
Onomil!

00:15:11.474 --> 00:15:15.274
It was unpreventable.

00:15:17.014 --> 00:15:19.534
Unpreventable?

00:15:21.184 --> 00:15:26.054
You let Onomil and the crew die,

00:15:27.224 --> 00:15:29.194
and you call it unpreventable?

00:15:29.654 --> 00:15:31.644
Why are you two still alive?!

00:15:32.194 --> 00:15:37.464
Why? Why did it have to be Onomil?!

00:15:39.334 --> 00:15:40.734
That Ekaril...

00:15:41.874 --> 00:15:44.494
Onomil died for her!

00:15:46.274 --> 00:15:48.244
Why?

00:15:49.914 --> 00:15:51.174
Blue.

00:15:51.614 --> 00:15:54.204
Replay the data from the engine malfunction.

00:15:54.784 --> 00:15:55.974
Roger.

00:16:08.194 --> 00:16:10.364
Warning, warning!

00:16:10.364 --> 00:16:13.164
Emil Force Drive rotations increasing!

00:16:13.604 --> 00:16:14.104
Pressure in all chambers reaching critical levels!

00:16:14.104 --> 00:16:15.374
Onomil!
Pressure in all chambers reaching critical levels!

00:16:15.374 --> 00:16:17.804
Pressure in all chambers reaching critical levels!

00:16:17.804 --> 00:16:19.674
Risk of damage to ship.

00:16:20.244 --> 00:16:21.574
I repeat.

00:16:21.574 --> 00:16:24.544
Emil Force Drive rotations increasing!

00:16:24.884 --> 00:16:28.444
Pressure in all chambers reaching critical levels!

00:16:29.214 --> 00:16:31.344
Onomil! Do you hear me, Onomil?

00:16:31.684 --> 00:16:34.154
It's not safe! Evacuate immediately!

00:16:36.524 --> 00:16:41.624
I must protect Commander Ekaril's ship!

00:16:42.594 --> 00:16:48.674
Rotations increasing... pressure rising?
But why? What's happening?

00:16:48.674 --> 00:16:51.644
Onomil! It's not safe! Evacuate!

00:16:53.604 --> 00:16:54.664
This is it!

00:16:54.974 --> 00:16:57.674
The overflow's moving backwards
in the bypass channels!

00:16:58.184 --> 00:17:00.274
Evacuate, Onomil!

00:17:00.344 --> 00:17:03.514
This mechanism... it's almost as if...

00:17:03.514 --> 00:17:06.784
Onomil! There's no time! Evacuate now!

00:17:07.324 --> 00:17:08.584
Commander!

00:17:09.754 --> 00:17:11.694
Commander! This ship is...

00:17:22.404 --> 00:17:32.744
Onomil was trying to regain control of the ship.
You understand now, don't you?

00:17:40.684 --> 00:17:41.914
Hey...

00:17:42.624 --> 00:17:43.984
Excuse me.

00:17:44.624 --> 00:17:47.154
I need to be alone.

00:17:57.004 --> 00:18:00.944
Perhaps we should think of a backup plan.

00:18:01.544 --> 00:18:03.944
We could find another play, perhaps.

00:18:04.814 --> 00:18:08.474
It's not the school festival I'm worried about.

00:18:14.154 --> 00:18:15.984
I showed her the recording of Onomil.

00:18:17.224 --> 00:18:19.664
Oh? How is she?

00:18:19.664 --> 00:18:25.254
Right now, she's locked
herself in Onomil's room.

00:18:26.734 --> 00:18:29.604
Let's give her a bit of time.

00:18:36.644 --> 00:18:37.944
Miss Kozuki?

00:18:41.884 --> 00:18:42.554
Chemistry Lab

00:18:42.554 --> 00:18:47.254
Chemistry Lab
I'm so sorry.

00:18:47.654 --> 00:18:49.594
Miss Kozuki, listen...

00:18:50.194 --> 00:18:55.354
Teacher! I just... I just couldn't do it!

00:18:55.994 --> 00:18:57.094
So I...

00:18:57.094 --> 00:18:59.864
It's all right, Miss Kozuki. Never mind!

00:19:00.134 --> 00:19:02.004
We can use another script!

00:19:02.004 --> 00:19:03.594
That's not it!

00:19:03.774 --> 00:19:05.244
I want to write it!

00:19:05.244 --> 00:19:07.004
I really want to write it!

00:19:09.144 --> 00:19:10.334
I really...

00:19:13.444 --> 00:19:15.414
I just...

00:19:18.684 --> 00:19:19.984
Miss Kozuki!

00:19:20.324 --> 00:19:23.684
Miss Kozuki! Can you hear me? Miss Kozuki!

00:19:28.634 --> 00:19:29.684
How is she?

00:19:30.734 --> 00:19:35.194
She bumped her head,
but it doesn't seem serious.

00:19:36.134 --> 00:19:39.574
They want her to rest a bit, just in case.

00:19:46.384 --> 00:19:48.354
I can't believe she fainted!

00:19:48.354 --> 00:19:51.874
You shouldn't have said the
script would be done next week!

00:19:51.984 --> 00:19:53.814
But Michi said so!

00:19:55.594 --> 00:19:56.954
Miss Kozuki...

00:19:57.694 --> 00:19:59.024
...must have really suffered.

00:20:03.734 --> 00:20:05.724
I'm sorry, Miss Kozuki.

00:20:06.904 --> 00:20:09.494
I really thought you were perfect for the job,

00:20:11.304 --> 00:20:13.394
but I drove you too hard!

00:20:23.554 --> 00:20:26.484
Everyone was counting on me, and I...

00:20:27.824 --> 00:20:31.224
Why can't I write it? Why?

00:20:33.524 --> 00:20:36.994
Yes, a slight case of anemia.

00:20:36.994 --> 00:20:41.094
Yes... Yes. I'm terribly sorry.

00:20:48.844 --> 00:20:53.674
You know, if you knew Michi was in a pinch,
you should have said something!

00:20:53.984 --> 00:20:55.244
Gimme a break!

00:20:55.354 --> 00:20:59.284
It's true. You are partially responsible.

00:20:59.824 --> 00:21:01.224
But I...

00:21:36.454 --> 00:21:38.324
Miss Kozuki? How do you feel?

00:21:39.694 --> 00:21:40.994
Oh, dear!

00:22:05.354 --> 00:22:06.944
Her engine...

00:22:08.394 --> 00:22:10.114
is up and running!

00:22:15.964 --> 00:22:18.694
Honestly... these Forime!

00:22:36.854 --> 00:22:44.344
Still, I think I'm starting to
understand how the Commander feels.

00:22:54.674 --> 00:22:56.104
I'm recording!

00:22:59.574 --> 00:23:01.074
Hey, stop it!

00:23:01.074 --> 00:23:02.374
Come closer!

00:23:06.284 --> 00:23:07.404
Like this?

00:23:12.224 --> 00:23:13.384
What?

00:23:14.524 --> 00:23:15.884
Come on!

00:23:29.534 --> 00:23:37.004
Futari narande te o tsunaida sora ni

00:23:37.814 --> 00:23:47.854
Mirai kasane chikau ano chiheisen

00:23:47.854 --> 00:23:55.524
Kaze ga yasashiku fuki nuketeku youni

00:23:56.234 --> 00:24:04.104
Bokura asu e toketetta

00:24:04.704 --> 00:24:08.314
Nagarete ku toki wa tada

00:24:08.314 --> 00:24:13.644
Shizuka ni kimi wo mimamotte

00:24:13.844 --> 00:24:17.584
Kanashimi mo "Sayonara" mo

00:24:17.584 --> 00:24:23.084
Aoi namida mo tsuyosa ni naru

00:24:24.424 --> 00:24:28.734
Bokura yume kakeru tsubomi

00:24:28.734 --> 00:24:33.564
Kotae sagashi ikiteku

00:24:33.564 --> 00:24:37.874
Hokori takaku saku hana ni

00:24:37.874 --> 00:24:43.574
Itsuka wa nareru to shinjiteta

00:24:43.574 --> 00:24:47.534
In the blue dreams!

00:25:01.294 --> 00:25:06.494
Mari and Hagino head into the next town to
buy supplies for the school festival.

00:25:07.034 --> 00:25:09.634
When they seek shelter from the
rain in a deserted building,

00:25:09.634 --> 00:25:12.104
Mari learns about a piece of Hagino's past.

00:25:12.844 --> 00:25:21.574
Meanwhile, the same memory fans the flames
of Azanael's hatred, fiercely and deeply.

00:25:22.814 --> 00:25:27.724
Next time on Blue Drop: Lagenaria siceraria.
